ues","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MaximalCliques","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic"}}}